# UX Before / After Report

## Baseline

Captured screenshots:

- `artifacts/screenshots/ux-baseline-provider-status.png`
- `artifacts/screenshots/ux-baseline-cisco.png`
- `artifacts/screenshots/ux-baseline-hpe-ilo.png`
